@startuml Dynamic Asset Addition Flow
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam BoxPadding 10

title Dynamic Asset Addition Flow - Current System

actor "Admin/User" as Admin
participant "GraphQL API" as GraphQL
participant "Organization\nService" as OrgService
database "Special Org\n(ASSET_SUPPORT_V2)" as SpecialOrg
participant "Approval\nWorkflow" as Approval
participant "HSM Queue\nPublisher" as HSMPublisher
participant "HSM" as HSM
participant "Asset Registry\nCron (60s)" as Cron
database "Asset Registry\nDatabase" as DB
participant "Asset Types\nClient (10s)" as Client
database "In-Memory\nCache" as Cache
participant "Services\n(Consumers)" as Services

== Asset Addition Phase ==

Admin -> GraphQL: requestAddAssetSupport mutation\n(networkID, assetTypeID, tokenType,\nname, decimals, etc.)
activate GraphQL

GraphQL -> OrgService: Create AssetSupportAddChange
activate OrgService

OrgService -> SpecialOrg: Apply change to\nSpecial Organization
note right
  Change adds new AssetConfig to
  org.AnchorageData.AssetConfigs[]

  Requires HSM signing:
  GetSkipHSMSigning() = false
  BioChallengeRequired() = true
end note
activate SpecialOrg

SpecialOrg --> OrgService: Organization updated\n(unsigned)
deactivate SpecialOrg

OrgService --> GraphQL: Operation created
deactivate OrgService

GraphQL --> Admin: Operation ID returned
deactivate GraphQL

== Approval & Signing Phase ==

Admin -> Approval: Approve operation\n(biometric challenge)
activate Approval

Approval -> OrgService: Trigger OrgChangeSignSendV2
activate OrgService

OrgService -> SpecialOrg: Get Special Org\nfor ASSET_SUPPORT_V2 purpose
activate SpecialOrg
SpecialOrg --> OrgService: HSMSignedOrganization
deactivate SpecialOrg

OrgService -> HSMPublisher: UpdateAndSignOrganizationChanges\n(operation, endorsements,\nencrypted org key, special org)
activate HSMPublisher

HSMPublisher -> HSM: Publish to HSM queue\n(SignOrganizationRequest)
note right
  Request includes:
  - OperationID
  - KeyBlob
  - PrevOrganization
  - NewOrganization with AssetConfigs
  - Endorsements
  - SpecialOrgs map
end note
activate HSM

HSM -> HSM: Sign new organization\nstate with updated\nAssetConfigs
HSM --> HSMPublisher: Signed organization
deactivate HSM

HSMPublisher --> OrgService: MessageID
deactivate HSMPublisher

OrgService -> SpecialOrg: Store signed\norganization
activate SpecialOrg
SpecialOrg --> OrgService: Stored
deactivate SpecialOrg

OrgService --> Approval: Operation completed
deactivate OrgService

Approval --> Admin: Asset approved & signed
deactivate Approval

== Asset Registry Sync Phase ==

loop Every 60 seconds
  Cron -> OrgService: GetOrganizationForPurpose\n(ASSET_SUPPORT_V2)
  activate Cron
  activate OrgService

  OrgService -> SpecialOrg: Retrieve signed\nspecial organization
  activate SpecialOrg
  SpecialOrg --> OrgService: HSMSignedOrganization\nwith all AssetConfigs
  deactivate SpecialOrg

  OrgService --> Cron: Organization with\nAssetConfigs[]
  deactivate OrgService

  Cron -> DB: Upsert asset configs\n(name, abbreviation,\ndecimals, networkID,\ntokenType, etc.)
  activate DB
  note right
    For each AssetConfig:
    - If exists: UPDATE if changed
    - If new: INSERT and create enablement

    Also registers globally via
    assettype.RegisterToken()
  end note
  DB --> Cron: Assets stored
  deactivate DB

  deactivate Cron
end

== Client Cache Population Phase ==

loop Every 10 seconds
  Client -> Cron: ListAssetTypes gRPC\n(OnlyXpress: true)
  activate Client
  activate Cron

  Cron -> DB: Query supported assets
  activate DB
  DB --> Cron: Asset list
  deactivate DB

  Cron --> Client: ListAssetTypesResponse\n(AssetTypes[])
  deactivate Cron

  Client -> Client: Register each asset\nvia RegisterToken()

  Client -> Cache: Store in assetTypesMap\n(assetTypeID -> RegisteredAsset)
  activate Cache
  Cache --> Client: Stored
  deactivate Cache

  Client -> Services: Trigger callbacks\nfor new assets
  activate Services
  note right
    Services can register callbacks
    to be notified when new
    assets are discovered
  end note
  Services --> Client: Acknowledged
  deactivate Services

  deactivate Client
end

== Asset Usage Phase ==

Services -> Client: Get(assetTypeID) or List()
activate Services
activate Client

Client -> Cache: Load from\nassetTypesMap
activate Cache
Cache --> Client: AssetInfo
deactivate Cache

Client --> Services: Asset information\n(name, decimals,\nnetworkID, etc.)
deactivate Client

Services -> Services: Use asset for\ntransactions, balances,\nvalidations, etc.
deactivate Services

@enduml
